Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:56:12 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] RenderManager: report the time of the picture on screen

The Blu-ray presented time is the pts of the frame on the plane. A
picture held for seconds while the next one waits in the queue for its
pts reports the same time throughout, so the OSD time and disc programs
that wait on it stop until the next picture shows. A drained last
picture ran on the clock without the user's video delay.
